@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Mengedit Data Semester (Tata Usaha)
actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "Database" as DB

== Akses Halaman Semester ==
TU -> UI: 1. Akses sidebar "Semester"
UI -> C: 2. Request semester page
C -> DB: 3. Get semester list
DB --> C: 4. Return semester data
C --> UI: 5. Load semester page
UI --> TU: 6. Tampilkan halaman semester dengan daftar semester

== Edit Semester ==
TU -> UI: 7. Klik tombol "Edit" pada baris semester
UI -> C: 8. Request edit mode for selected semester
C -> DB: 9. Get semester data by ID
DB --> C: 10. Return semester data
C --> UI: 11. Enable edit mode
UI --> TU: 12. Tampilkan form edit (field Batch dapat diedit)

TU -> UI: 13. Ubah data di field "Batch"

alt Simpan perubahan
    TU -> UI: 14. Klik tombol simbol centang (simpan)
    UI -> C: 15. Handle save submission
    C -> C: 15.1. Validate form data
    note right
    - Batch tidak boleh kosong
    - Batch maksimal 2 digit
    end note
    alt Data valid
        C -> DB: 15.2. Update semester data
        DB --> C: 15.3. Semester updated successfully
        C -> DB: 15.4. Get updated semester list
        DB --> C: 15.5. Return updated data
        C --> UI: 15.6. Success response + refresh data
        UI --> TU: 15.7. Tampilkan daftar semester terbaru (mode edit disabled)
    else Data tidak valid
        C --> UI: 15.2. Validation error
        UI --> TU: 15.3. Tampilkan pesan error + tetap dalam mode edit
        note right
        - "Formulir Batch harus terisi"
        - "Batch tidak boleh lebih dari 2 digit"
        end note
    end
else Batal perubahan
    TU -> UI: 14. Klik tombol simbol silang (batal)
    UI -> C: 15. Cancel edit request
    C --> UI: 16. Disable edit mode
    UI --> TU: 17. Kembali ke tampilan normal (data tidak berubah)
end
@enduml